to start animation:
1. create '@keyframe name(any){}'
2. write into it 'from' and 'to' section (basically defining animation). from and to is only used when we have to define initial and final position. else we can use % method to define every stage of animation.
3.use 'animation-name: nameofanimation' in the element you want animation
4. also define duration of animation.


